<title>HONG KONG: HK dlr Jan M-3 rises 21.1 pct on year.</title>
<headline>HK dlr Jan M-3 rises 21.1 pct on year.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hong Kong Monetary Authority gave the following money supply figures as percentage changes:</p>
<p>				   Jan '97    Dec '96     Jan '96</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (year-on-year)  +21.1	 +19.0	 +14.7</p>
<p> HK dollar M-3 (month)	    +2.6	  -0.7	  +0.8</p>
</text>
